# spec: SETGET [1.7] EQ writes one band at a time as [value, band]; flat is three writes of 0, bands 0, 1, 2 in order.
# source: NOTES.md SETGET table ([1.7] 2 bytes: [value, bandId]); the replies are synthetic, the captured [1.7] layout with each band at 0
device qc_ultra2
call set_eq 0 0 0
send 01 07 02 02 00 00
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 00 00 f6 0a fe 01 f6 0a fa 02
send 01 07 02 02 00 01
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 00 00 f6 0a 00 01 f6 0a fa 02
send 01 07 02 02 00 02
recv 01 07 03 0c f6 0a 00 00 f6 0a 00 01 f6 0a 00 02
result ok
